{"3629330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beyonders", "steam_appid": 3629330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyonders follows a 5-person co-op elite space crew (including one dog!) sent across the solar system to investigate anomalies, recover lost assets, and survive extreme environments. Using the scientific method and cooperative engineering, players complete missions. &quot;Could it be aliens? Never!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629330/extras/f0c82ebd7af54297e5ccf7a388d4c8a3.avif?t=1780341858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629330/extras_big/f0c82ebd7af54297e5ccf7a388d4c8a3.webp?t=1780341858 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Clues, Propose a Hypothesis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629330/extras/0449f47aad0faa32cc2355319e245b01.poster.avif?t=1780341858\" width=920 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629330/extras/0449f47aad0faa32cc2355319e245b01.webm?t=1780341858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629330/extras/0449f47aad0faa32cc2355319e245b01.mp4?t=1780341858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyonders' unique proposition is this: survive with your team long enough to uncover the mystery and set the planet right again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Experiments and Test Your Theories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629330/extras/6cb1979a9bc8d076f0ad48dfd8f0bbaf.poster.avif?t=1780341858\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629330/extras/6cb1979a9bc8d076f0ad48dfd8f0bbaf.webm?t=1780341858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629330/extras/6cb1979a9bc8d076f0ad48dfd8f0bbaf.mp4?t=1780341858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover clues and unlock Beyonders team experiments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyonders follows a 5-person co-op elite space crew (including one dog!) sent across the solar system to investigate anomalies, recover lost assets, and survive extreme environments. Using the scientific method and cooperative engineering, players complete missions. &quot;Could it be aliens? Never!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629330/extras/f0c82ebd7af54297e5ccf7a388d4c8a3.avif?t=1780341858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629330/extras_big/f0c82ebd7af54297e5ccf7a388d4c8a3.webp?t=1780341858 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Clues, Propose a Hypothesis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629330/extras/0449f47aad0faa32cc2355319e245b01.poster.avif?t=1780341858\" width=920 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629330/extras/0449f47aad0faa32cc2355319e245b01.webm?t=1780341858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"htt